5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Hi everyone. Since our current habit isn't working, we should establish a sustainable system for the year. Let's start by gathering some objective data so we can make a fair and practical decision.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I couldn't agree more, Minako. A bit of objective data should save us from the perils of guesswork and emotional debates. I'm quite looking forward to seeing what the evidence suggests for our little community.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A big house meeting! I'm so excited to help make everything sparkly clean! Let's find some cool clues first so we can figure out the best way to do this! What should we look at?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see everyone coming together like this. I agree that we should be thoughtful. I would like to see the ""Management office rate sheet and billing"" and the ""Bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts.""","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see such a spirited gathering. In my experience, the heart of a home is found in how we care for one another. Let us seek a path that preserves our harmony.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I want to understand the actual time commitment involved. I'll look into the ""Stopwatch timing of a full pass"" and the ""Standard terms of the outside firm"" to see if outsourcing is a viable alternative.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure we aren't merely rearranging the deck chairs on a sinking ship, I'll examine ""A fortnight's watch on kitchen use"" and ""Absences on the wall calendar."" I suspect the actual usage patterns are quite telling.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to solve the mystery of the messy rooms! I'll check ""What each housemate counts as done"" and ""Rows recorded in the house chat"" to see why we're all so confused!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I believe it is important that we all feel comfortable and cared for. I will stick with my choices, as I hope to understand how we can manage our shared expenses more gently and fairly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"To ensure we understand the roots of our friction, I shall look into the ""Rows recorded in the house chat"" and the ""Note left by the previous tenants."" Wisdom often hides in the lessons of the past.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have a good distribution of research. We are covering the time, the costs, the social friction, and the history of the house. I believe this will give us a comprehensive view of the situation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a most comprehensive spread. We have the pragmatists handling the clock and the coin, while Sakura and Servas dive into the archives of our domestic dramas. It should be quite illuminating.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm like a detective on a mission! I'll find out all the secrets of the house chat and what everyone thinks ""clean"" actually means! I bet it's going to be super interesting!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am simply happy that we are all so motivated to help one another. I look forward to seeing what you all discover; I am sure it will help us find a very peaceful way forward.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us embrace this process with patience. Whether the data reveals a need for more effort or a new system, the true goal is to ensure we remain friends long after the floors are clean.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let's proceed with our research and reconvene once we have the results. I'll be interested to see if the actual time required matches our perceptions. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall retire to my studies then. I eagerly anticipate the revelation of our habits—it's always fascinating to see how the reality of our lives differs from the stories we tell ourselves. Until next time.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm off to find those clues! I'll be the best house detective ever! I can't wait to see what everyone finds out. See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall go and look into my chosen papers now. I hope the information helps us create a home where everyone feels a sense of peace and fairness. I will see you all very soon.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall now reflect upon the records and the echoes of those who lived here before us. May our findings lead us toward a solution that nourishes our spirits and our friendship. Until we meet again.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
